        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Love the plugin! Pretty much replacing noice for me. \n\nI did find one issue with the autocomplete. Using this minimally reproducible config\n```lua\nvim.pack.add({\n    { src = \"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim\" },\n})\n\nvim.pack.update()\n\nrequire(\"mini.cmdline\").setup()\n```\nIf you enter cmd mode, start the auto complete, and then delete all characters and then press `esc`, the autocomplete menu stays open.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/902a868a-624a-435e-9436-1a9d2fb837a9",
