        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> If you enter cmd mode, start the auto complete, and then delete all characters and then press `esc`, the autocomplete menu stays open.\n\nPlease update to the latest Neovim Nightly, this is not the behavior already. There were some issues with `vim.fn.wildtrigger()` which were fixed relatively lately.\n\n---\n\nAlso, please, don't include `vim.pack.update()` call into reproduction example. Or in any config file, for that matter. It is meant for intentional manual use to update plugins.",
